{"id": "sf-assessor-smart-system-delay", "title": "A late property assessment system cost the City $9.7 million more to implement", "seconds": 41.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "85569564e395e47f", "words": 117, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "November 2021 was the target for a new assessment system.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.51, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["When", "did", "it", "go", "live?"], "sub": "A missed target"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.73, 1.3, 1.45, 1.58, 1.94, 2.14, 2.23, 2.4, 2.89]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Phase 2 went live in September 2025.", "t0": 3.63, "t1": 6.26, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "analyst", "kicker": "A missed target", "text": "Phase 2", "mark": "Phase"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.57, 0.81, 1.1, 1.21, 1.73, 2.01]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Assessor identified a design flaw during implementation.", "t0": 6.38, "t1": 9.38, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The Assessor identified a design flaw during implementation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.62, 1.18, 1.28, 1.68, 1.97, 2.23]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "A joint review attributed 92% of the delay to Sapient.", "t0": 9.6, "t1": 13.06, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "92%", "label": "Who bore the added cost?"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.41, 0.75, 1.29, 1.8, 2.19, 2.29, 2.43, 2.77, 2.89]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "City implementation costs rose from $15.1 million to $24.8 million.", "t0": 13.18, "t1": 19.01, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "analyst", "kicker": "Who bore the added cost?", "text": "$24.8 million", "mark": "$24.8"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 1.12, 1.48, 1.74, 1.92, 2.37, 2.7, 2.92, 3.25, 3.76, 3.94, 4.52, 4.82, 5.08, 5.4]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Sapient also contributed $15.3 million to implementation.", "t0": 19.13, "t1": 23.25, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Sapient also contributed $15.3 million to implementation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.5, 0.79, 1.39, 1.94, 2.21, 2.5, 2.86, 3.18, 3.32]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The Board authorized another $6,754,000, including maintenance and support.", "t0": 23.37, "t1": 28.21, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "authority", "kicker": "What the Board authorized", "text": "$6,754,000", "mark": "$6,754,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.43, 1.02, 1.38, 1.67, 1.94, 2.21, 2.38, 2.69, 3.33, 3.84, 4.28, 4.4]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The Assessor reported no credits assessed for incident response times.", "t0": 28.33, "t1": 31.84, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The Assessor reported no credits assessed for incident response times"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.62, 1.08, 1.28, 1.66, 2.06, 2.23, 2.64, 3.08]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "We traced 117 payment lines in the Controller’s ledger.", "t0": 32.06, "t1": 35.55, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "cash", "kicker": "Checking actual payments", "text": "117 lines", "mark": "117"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.55, 0.79, 1.09, 1.69, 2.05, 2.37, 2.46, 2.57, 3.11]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "They match the total paid in the contract register.", "t0": 35.67, "t1": 38.19, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "They match the total paid in the contract register"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.51, 0.66, 1.0, 1.28, 1.37, 1.49, 2.0]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is